                      "contract_version": 3,
                      "status": "completed",
                      "human_status": "refined",
                      "verdict": "refined",
                      "explanation": "Correct except the date. Pricing starts 1 October, not 1 September.",
                      "response": "Correct except the date. Pricing starts 1 October, not 1 September.",
                      "response_time_ms": 15278000,
                      "ready_at": "2026-10-01T13:12:40+00:00",
                      "unlocked_at": "2026-10-01T13:20:05+00:00",
                      "next_action": "done"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "The verify id is not a UUID.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                },
                "example": {
                  "error": "invalid verify id"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/NotFound"
          },
          "502": {
            "$ref": "#/components/responses/BackendUnavailable"
          }
        },
        "security": []
      }
    },
    "/verify-unlock": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "verify"
        ],
        "operationId": "unlockVerify",
        "summary": "Gates 2 and 3: unlock the ready human result",
        "description": "Call this only when status is ready. Before that the endpoint answers 409 and asks for no payment.\n\nWithout ?id= naming a chain, or with an unknown id, the endpoint answers 402 with the unlock price band: every accepted asset at both the SLA and the grace price, from the current quote. That 402 describes the prices; it unlocks nothing. A payment made against it is refused with 400 or 404 and never settled.\n\nThe unlock costs 1.45 to 2.90 EUR, decided by when the human answered: 2.90 EUR (SLA price) if ready_at is within 60 minutes of admitted_at, 1.45 EUR (grace price) if it is later, within 24 hours. A boundary instant belongs to the earlier window. When the agent polls or unlocks does not change the price.\n\nThe endpoint answers 402 with exactly one exact requirement: the asset the admission was paid in, at service_window.unlock_amount. With 1 EUR = 1.17 USD that is 3400000 (SLA) or 1700000 (grace) atomic USDC, and 2900000 or 1450000 atomic EURC. Its extensions[\"service-windows\"].info repeats terms_id, applied, admitted_at, ready_at, network, asset, and unlock_amount, so the agent can check the arithmetic against the terms it paid for at admission. Refuse to sign if the asset differs or the amount is higher than the bound amount for the applied window. Sign the requirement with the requester wallet and repeat the same request. An admission credit never covers this gate.\n\nThe result body is released only after the unlock settlement succeeds. Unlocking twice does not charge twice: once the chain is completed, the answer is returned without a new payment.",
        "x-payment-info": {
          "price": {
            "mode": "dynamic",
            "currency": "EUR",
            "min": "1.45",
            "max": "2.90"
          },
          "protocols": [
            {
              "x402": {}
            }
          ]
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/VerifyIdQuery"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/parameters/PaymentSignature"
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Completed. The human answer is included. The body is built before the settlement is recorded, so unlocked_at is still null here; it appears on the next poll.",
            "headers": {
              "PAYMENT-RESPONSE": {
                "$ref": "#/components/headers/PaymentResponse"
              }
            },
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VerifyState"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "slaUsdc": {
                    "summary": "USDC chain unlocked at the SLA price: 0.12 + 3.40 USDC.",
                    "value": {
                      "verify_id": "0f3f7d0a-6a1c-4a1e-9d7a-2f6b5b0f9c11",
                      "work_id": "0f3f7d0a-6a1c-4a1e-9d7a-2f6b5b0f9c11",
                      "contract_version": 3,
                      "status": "completed",
                      "human_status": "refined",
                      "verdict": "refined",
                      "explanation": "Correct except the date. Pricing starts 1 October, not 1 September.",
                      "response": "Correct except the date. Pricing starts 1 October, not 1 September.",
                      "response_time_ms": 2473000,
                      "wallet_address": "0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111",
                      "funding": {
